   "locked": false,
   "text": "  \ud83d\udcc4 <page>/<stem>.md                    the SOURCE \u00b7 haipipe-page owns it\n        \u2502 POST /_board/latex             live/export.py\n        \u25bc\n  \ud83d\udee0 md2tex.py  \u2500\u2500\u25b6  latex/<stem>.tex    ### \u2192 \\section \u00b7 lanes dropped\n        \u2502            + <stem>-master.tex  generic article \u00b7 natbib iff a\n        \u25bc                                 0-*.bib is in reach upward\n  \ud83e\uddee xelatex (+bibtex when a bib)  \u2500\u2500\u25b6  latex/<stem>.pdf\n        \u2502            -master.* residue deleted after the run\n        \u25bc\n  \ud83d\uddbc the \ud83d\udcdc LaTeX tab frames the PDF \u00b7 compile failure frames a view\n     page carrying the .tex and the log tail instead of silence",
   "originalText": "  \ud83d\udcc4 <page>/<stem>.md                    the SOURCE \u00b7 haipipe-page owns it\n        \u2502 POST /_board/latex             live/export.py\n        \u25bc\n  \ud83d\udee0 md2tex.py  \u2500\u2500\u25b6  latex/<stem>.tex    ### \u2192 \\section \u00b7 lanes dropped\n        \u2502            + <stem>-master.tex  generic article \u00b7 natbib iff a\n        \u25bc                                 0-*.bib is in reach upward\n  \ud83e\uddee xelatex (+bibtex when a bib)  \u2500\u2500\u25b6  latex/<stem>.pdf\n        \u2502            -master.* residue deleted after the run\n        \u25bc\n  \ud83d\uddbc the \ud83d\udcdc LaTeX tab frames the PDF \u00b7 compile failure frames a view\n     page carrying the .tex and the log tail instead of silence",
   "fontSize": 14,
